* Component models for circuit_lab circuits.

* LED lamp. Pins: l (brown, "phase"), n (blue, "neutral").
* Level 1: lamp as a resistor, P at 230 V RMS.
.subckt lamp_r l n p=8
R1 l n {230*230/p}
.ends lamp_r

* Switch contact. on > 0.5 - closed.
.subckt switch a b on=0 ron=0.01 roff=1e9
R1 a b {on > 0.5 ? ron : roff}
.ends switch
